      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMOOTH TIGER (7) flew the lids from out wide with an impressive turn of foot before finishing second (24.85) and beaten half a length over 435m at this track. Good form should continue. MUGSHOT (8) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (23.59) in a Grade 5 at Warragul. Form here is sound including six wins. Key runner on best form. LETHAL AVENGER (1) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 435m behind MUGSHOT (25.46) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Can measure up this time. INTRIGUE (4) did a good job to finish third last time out over 435m at this track (24.93) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
